"""Hand-picked Hebrew and Greek words for the Key words strip (build_keywords.py).

Each entry: (strong, gloss, note, pins)

    strong  A Strong's number as the texts tag it. With a sub-meaning letter
            ("H2617A") only that sense counts; without one ("H1285") every
            sense of the number counts. Several can be joined with "|" when
            one word is tagged more than one way ("G4236|G4240").
    gloss   A short English meaning shown on the chip.
    note    One sentence on why the word is worth noticing. Written for this
            site; keep it plain, accurate and free of denominational positions.
    pins    Chapter pages where the word must be shown even if the scoring
            would not pick it there (its classic passage).

Order matters a little: earlier entries win ties.
"""

